`an application after 2 years` MEANS Application WITH
    `years since the judgment, or since the last appeal judgment` IS 2
    `wholly satisfied at the application date` IS FALSE
    `discharged at the application date` IS FALSE
    `enforceable in the country of the original court at the application date` IS TRUE
    `the court finds enforcement just and convenient` IS FALSE

`an application after 7 years` MEANS Application WITH
    `years since the judgment, or since the last appeal judgment` IS 7
    `wholly satisfied at the application date` IS FALSE
    `discharged at the application date` IS FALSE
    `enforceable in the country of the original court at the application date` IS TRUE
    `the court finds enforcement just and convenient` IS FALSE

